 "about": "Where each town's The Curse of Alduin station stands: inside the walled cities (their own worldspaces: the market or main square) and in the heart of each town. (Noah, Oct 2026: every spot now placed by hand in scout mode - stood on, N pressed; the stand faces the way he faced.) Picked offline from Skyrim.esm's navmesh (spots2.py: open ground where paths meet, at least 2-3 m clear of any building or prop all round, near level out to 3 m; the whole compacted stand and its approach on walkable, near-level ground, clear of doors), then checked in game. x, y, z in the worldspace; yawDeg turns the stand (its front, where you walk up, faces local -y); compact shrinks the stand's layout to fit city streets. The world-map icon of a walled city stays at its gate outside.",
